WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.206
Unit eleven. Taking Care of Devices!

2
00:00:05.085 --> 00:00:09.525
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:12.819
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.869 --> 00:00:17.157
Today we learn about Taking Care of Devices. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:22.755
Care. Say it with me. Care!

6
00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:30.775
Clean screen. Say it with me. Clean screen!

7
00:00:34.237 --> 00:00:37.870
Gentle. Say it with me. Gentle!

8
00:00:41.449 --> 00:00:45.477
Protect. Say it with me. Protect!

9
00:00:48.897 --> 00:00:52.495
Case. Say it with me. Case!

10
00:00:56.061 --> 00:01:00.913
Avoid drops. Say it with me. Avoid drops!

11
00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:08.145
Careful. Say it with me. Careful!

12
00:01:11.636 --> 00:01:15.486
Handle. Say it with me. Handle!

13
00:01:18.936 --> 00:01:27.723
Taking care of a device means being gentle and careful. I clean the screen, use a protective case, and avoid dropping it.

14
00:01:27.773 --> 00:01:30.930
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:31.674 --> 00:01:37.071
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.121 --> 00:01:38.271
Gentle!

17
00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:44.565
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:45.765
Careful!

19
00:01:46.711 --> 00:01:53.379
Did you know? A protective case can help a device survive a drop that might otherwise crack the screen!

20
00:01:53.429 --> 00:01:55.667
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:06.813
Think and answer. What is one way you take care of your device or a family device?

22
00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:08.017
Great answer!

23
00:02:08.964 --> 00:02:14.809
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:14.859 --> 00:02:17.975
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

